      "date": "2026-05-04T08:43:27.000Z",
      "title": "Price target increased by 11% to ₹749",
      "body": "Up from ₹678, the current price target is an average from 7 analysts. New target price is 7.0% above last closing price of ₹700. Stock is up 52% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹31.12 for next year compared to ₹24.47 last year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "4f43043b-1e30-4a52-992e-2562b874f998",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-01T20:13:00.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS in line with analyst expectations despite revenue beat",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹24.47 (up from ₹20.69 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹53.9b (up 20% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹5.95b (up 19% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 11% (in line with FY 2025). Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 1.1%. Earnings per share (EPS) were mostly in line with analyst estimates. Revenue is forecast to grow 13% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 11% growth forecast for the Pharmaceuticals industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 9% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 33% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
