      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-04-29T07:03:00.000Z",
      "title": "Granules India Limited Recommends Final Dividend for the Financial Year 2025-2026",
      "body": "Granules India Limited announced that the board recommended a final dividend of INR 1.75/- per share of the face value of INR 1/- each for the financial year 2025-26, representing 175% of the paid-up equity share capital of the company. The record date for payment of the final dividend shall be July 30, 2026. The dividend will be proposed at the AGM to be held on August 6, 2026.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "46",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "4528582d-dac5-4638-8695-d9edde6fcff1",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-04-28T11:40:32.000Z",
      "title": "Now 22% overvalued after recent price rise",
      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has risen 25% to ₹705. The fair value is estimated to be ₹580, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 2.9% over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has grown by 4.8%. Revenue is forecast to grow by 33% in 2 years. Earnings are forecast to grow by 61% in the next 2 years.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
